    "custom_liquid_LNgPea": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- assign ypp_custom = collections['planners'] -%}\n{%- assign ypp_ready = collections['built-by-us'] -%}\n{%- assign ypp_hero = 'start-here-jess.jpg' | file_url -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ypp-sh, .ypp-sh * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .ypp-sh { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; color: #2b2224; line-height: 1.6; scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n  .ypp-sh h1, .ypp-sh h2, .ypp-sh h3 { letter-spacing: normal; }\n  .ypp-sh-display { font-family: 'Wild Mango', 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: normal; }\n  .ypp-sh-hero { background-color: #e6e2e3; background-image: url('{{ ypp_hero }}'); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center bottom; background-size: auto 100%; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .ypp-sh-hero { background-size: cover; min-height: 680px !important; } }\n  .ypp-sh-track { display: flex; gap: 20px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; padding-bottom: 12px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }\n  .ypp-sh-track::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }\n  .ypp-sh-track::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #fad8da; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .ypp-sh-faq summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; min-height: 44px; }\n  .ypp-sh-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  .ypp-sh-faq summary::after { content: '+'; flex-shrink: 0; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ff4545; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; line-height: 32px; text-align: center; font-weight: 500; }\n  .ypp-sh-faq[open] summary::after { content: '\\2212'; }\n  .ypp-sh-link { color: #ff9cae; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n  .ypp-sh-link:hover { color: #ff4545; }\n  #ypp-custom, #ypp-ready-made { scroll-margin-top: 90px; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ypp-sh\">\n\n  <div class=\"ypp-sh-hero\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Jess sitting in a chair holding a Your Perfect Planner, waving\" style=\"min-height: 900px; padding: 36px 24px 0;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 10px;\">\n      <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em; font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); line-height: 1.05; color: #ff4545;\">New here?</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 520px; color: #2b2224;\">Hi, I’m Jess, the founder of Your Perfect Planner. After years of trying planners that never quite worked, I built my own, and now, you can too! Don’t worry if it feels like a lot of choice. I’ll walk you through everything below.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"padding: 88px 24px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px;\">\n      <h2 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; text-align: center; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.15; color: #2b2224;\">To put it simply, we sell two types of planners</h2>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 32px);\">\n        <a href=\"#ypp-custom\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2b2224; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; text-align: center;\">\n          <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; background: #fad8da;\">\n            {%- if ypp_custom.image -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ ypp_custom.image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Custom planners\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\">\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px); line-height: 1.1; white-space: nowrap; color: #2b2224;\">Custom</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 16px); color: #2b2224;\">You choose every page.</p>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"#ypp-ready-made\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2b2224; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; text-align: center;\">\n          <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; background: #fdf1f0;\">\n            {%- if ypp_ready.image -%}\n              <img src=\"{{ ypp_ready.image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Ready-made planners\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\">\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px); line-height: 1.1; white-space: nowrap; color: #2b2224;\">Ready-made</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 16px); color: #2b2224;\">The planner is already designed, just choose the one that suits you best.</p>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"ypp-ready-made\" style=\"padding: 88px 0; background: #fdf1f0;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff9cae;\">Grab and go</p>\n          <h2 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; color: #2b2224;\">Ready-made</h2>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; max-width: 560px; color: #2b2224;\">Choose the planner that best suits your life. The pages are all done for you, but you still get to pick your cover!</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"{{ ypp_ready.url }}\" class=\"ypp-sh-link\">Shop all ready-made</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ypp-sh-track\">\n        {%- for product in ypp_ready.products limit: 12 -%}\n          <a href=\"{{ product.url }}\" style=\"flex: 0 0 260px; scroll-snap-align: start; text-decoration: none; color: #2b2224; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n            <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 176 / 230; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: #fad8da;\">\n              {%- if product.featured_image -%}\n                <img src=\"{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}\" alt=\"{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"784\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\">\n              {%- endif -%}\n            </div>\n            <span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4;\">{{ product.title }}</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #6e5559;\">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price_min | money }}</span>\n          </a>\n        {%- endfor -%}\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6e5559;\">Swipe to see more.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"ypp-custom\" style=\"padding: 88px 24px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff9cae;\">Build your own</p>\n        <h2 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; color: #2b2224;\">Custom Planners</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Think of it like building your own sandwich: you pick exactly what goes in, and leave out what you don't need. Here are the steps you'll go through:</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n        {%- capture ypp_steps -%}Select daily or weekly|Daily gives you a whole page for each day. Weekly gives you your full week at a glance.~Set your date range|Calendar year, financial year or anything in between. Start whenever suits you.~Choose your layout|Pick how your pages look so they match the way you like to plan.~Add pages to the front of your planner|Set yourself up for the year ahead.~Add pages in between each week|Extra pages that repeat every week such as weekly tasks, weekly reflection, notes and to-do lists.~Add pages in between each month|Extra pages that repeat every month such as a monthly view, budget trackers and habit trackers.~Add pages at the back of your planner|Room for everything else you want to keep together.~Choose your cover|The fun bit! Pick the cover that makes you smile every time you open it.{%- endcapture -%}\n        {%- assign ypp_step_list = ypp_steps | split: '~' -%}\n        {%- for step in ypp_step_list -%}\n          {%- assign ypp_parts = step | split: '|' -%}\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px;\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ff4545; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">{{ forloop.index }}</span>\n              {%- unless forloop.last -%}\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 3px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 24px; background: #fad8da;\">&nbsp;</span>\n              {%- endunless -%}\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding: 10px 0 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; color: #2b2224;\">{{ ypp_parts[0] }}</h3>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">{{ ypp_parts[1] }}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        {%- endfor -%}\n      </div>\n      {%- assign ypp_daily_url = ypp_custom.url -%}\n      {%- assign ypp_weekly_url = ypp_custom.url -%}\n      {%- for p in ypp_custom.products -%}\n        {%- if p.title contains 'Daily' -%}{%- assign ypp_daily_url = p.url -%}{%- endif -%}\n        {%- if p.title contains 'Weekly' -%}{%- assign ypp_weekly_url = p.url -%}{%- endif -%}\n      {%- endfor -%}\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;\">\n        <a href=\"{{ ypp_daily_url }}\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0; max-width: 240px; min-width: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ff4545; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none;\">Build daily</a>\n        <a href=\"{{ ypp_weekly_url }}\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0; max-width: 240px; min-width: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ff4545; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none;\">Build weekly</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"padding: 88px 24px; background: #fdf1f0;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; text-align: center; align-items: center;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff9cae;\">Good to know</p>\n        <h2 class=\"ypp-sh-display\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; color: #2b2224;\">FAQs</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">What size are your planners?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">All of our planners are 176 × 230 mm. We only make the one size at this stage. It's bigger than A5, but smaller than A4.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">What paper do you use, and how thick is it?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">We print on 120gsm FSC certified paper. It's a lovely thick paper that feels great to write on, and most pens and highlighters don't bleed through.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Can I design my own layout?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Yes! If none of the available layouts work for you, or you want something really specific, you're welcome to design your own. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0870/1021/4194/files/DIY_Page_Guide.pdf?v=1793908768\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #ff4545; font-weight: 700;\">See the DIY Page Guide here</a>.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">How long does my planner take to be made?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Every custom planner is made to order, so please allow 1 to 14 days for us to make it, plus shipping time.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Do I have to start my planner in January?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Not at all! You can choose a calendar year, a financial year or any date range in between. If you'd rather not have dates at all, have a look at our <a href=\"{{ collections['custom-undated-planners'].url }}\" style=\"color: #ff4545; font-weight: 700;\">undated planners</a>.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Can I leave out weekends in a daily planner?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Yes! In a daily planner you can leave weekends out completely, or give them half a page each so they take up less room.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Is there a limit to how many pages I can add?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Custom planners can hold up to 386 pages in total. If you're choosing a daily planner with lots of extras, keep an eye on your page count. Want all the extras? You can split your planner in two, usually as two 6-month planners, so you can add every page you want.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">Where are your planners made?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">Every planner is handmade right here in Australia, on the Central Coast of NSW. When you order, you're supporting a real Aussie small business.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">How big is the coil?</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">The size of the coil depends on how many pages you choose, so the more pages, the bigger the coil. If you'd prefer a small coil, we recommend going with a weekly planner or not adding too many extra pages.</p>\n        </details>\n\n        <details class=\"ypp-sh-faq\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 24px;\">\n          <summary style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #2b2224;\">I still have a question</summary>\n          <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 16px; color: #4a3b3e;\">No problem at all! Email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@yourperfectplanner.com.au\" style=\"color: #ff4545; font-weight: 700;\">hello@yourperfectplanner.com.au</a> and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>\n        </details>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
